<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Curriculum Vitae</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-name { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .subsection-title { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .entry-date { font-style: italic; font-size: 10pt; }
  .metadata { font-size: 10pt; color: #555; }
  .list-item { margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .two-column { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  .two-column > div { width: 48%; }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #000;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 1.5em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .page-number {
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 1em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
  }
  tr td:first-child {
    font-weight: bold;
    width: 30%;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 class="header-name">{{ full_name }}</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">CURRICULUM VITAE</p>
  </div>

  <div class="two-column">
    <div>
      <div class="subsection-title">Office address:</div>
      <p><span data-field="address.line1">{{ address.line1 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="address.line2">{{ address.line2 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="address.line3">{{ address.line3 }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="subsection-title">Home address:</div>
      <p><span data-field="address.home_line1">{{ address.home_line1 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="address.home_line2">{{ address.home_line2 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="address.home_line3">{{ address.home_line3 }}</span></p>
      <p>Telephone: <span data-field="phone_home">{{ phone_home }}</span></p>
      <p>Email: <span data-field="email_home">{{ email_home }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">EDUCATION</div>
  <div class="list-item">
    <span data-field="education.institution_name">{{ education.institution_name }}</span>, <span data-field="education.department">{{ education.department }}</span>.
    <span data-field="education.degree">{{ education.degree }}</span>.
    <span data-field="education.details">{{ education.details }}</span>.
    <span data-field="education.year">{{ education.year }}</span>.
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">PROFESSIONAL EMPLOYMENT</div>
  <div class="list-item">
    <span data-field="employment.title">{{ employment.title }}</span> at <span data-field="employment.institution">{{ employment.institution }}</span>, <span data-field="employment.dates">{{ employment.dates }}</span>.
    <p style="margin-left: 20px;"><span data-field="employment.description">{{ employment.description }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">PUBLICATIONS</div>
  <div class="subsection-title">ARTICLES</div>
  {% for pub in publications.articles %}
    <div class="list-item">
      <span data-field="publications.articles[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ pub.title }}</span>.
      <span data-field="publications.articles[{{ loop.index0 }}].journal">{{ pub.journal }}</span>, <span data-field="publications.articles[{{ loop.index0 }}].volume">{{ pub.volume }}</span>, pp. <span data-field="publications.articles[{{ loop.index0 }}].pages">{{ pub.pages }}</span>. <span data-field="publications.articles[{{ loop.index0 }}].year">{{ pub.year }}</span>.
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="subsection-title">BOOKS</div>
  {% for pub in publications.books %}
    <div class="list-item">
      <span data-field="publications.books[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ pub.title }}</span>.
      <span data-field="publications.books[{{ loop.index0 }}].publisher">{{ pub.publisher }}</span>, <span data-field="publications.books[{{ loop.index0 }}].year">{{ pub.year }}</span>.
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="subsection-title">CHAPTERS</div>
  {% for pub in publications.chapters %}
    <div class="list-item">
      <span data-field="publications.chapters[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ pub.title }}</span>.
      In <span data-field="publications.chapters[{{ loop.index0 }}].book_title">{{ pub.book_title }}</span>, pp. <span data-field="publications.chapters[{{ loop.index0 }}].pages">{{ pub.pages }}</span>. <span data-field="publications.chapters[{{ loop.index0 }}].year">{{ pub.year }}</span>.
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="section-title">PRESENTATIONS</div>
  {% for pres in presentations %}
    <div class="list-item">
      <span data-field="presentations[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ pres.title }}</span>.
      <span data-field="presentations[{{ loop.index0 }}].conference">{{ pres.conference }}</span>, <span data-field="presentations[{{ loop.index0 }}].location">{{ pres.location }}</span>, <span data-field="presentations[{{ loop.index0 }}].date">{{ pres.date }}</span>.
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="section-title">SERVICE AND AFFILIATIONS</div>
  {% for service in services %}
    <div class="list-item">
      <span data-field="services[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ service.title }}</span>.
      <span data-field="services[{{ loop.index0 }}].details">{{ service.details }}</span>.
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <span data-field="page_number">{{ page_number }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">REVIEWS</div>
  {% for review in reviews %}
    <div class="list-item">
      <span data-field="reviews[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ review.title }}</span>.
      <span data-field="reviews[{{ loop.index0 }}].journal">{{ review.journal }}</span>, <span data-field="reviews[{{ loop.index0 }}].date">{{ review.date }}</span>.
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="section-title">WORKSHOPS AND LECTURES</div>
  {% for workshop in workshops %}
    <div class="list-item">
      <span data-field="workshops[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ workshop.title }}</span>.
      <span data-field="workshops[{{ loop.index0 }}].details">{{ workshop.details }}</span>.
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="section-title">SKILLS</div>
  {% for skill in skills %}
    <span data-field="skills[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ skill }}</span>
  {% endfor %}

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <span data-field="page_number">{{ page_number }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">OTHER ACTIVITIES</div>
  {% for activity in activities %}
    <div class="list-item">
      <span data-field="activities[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ activity.title }}</span>.
      <span data-field="activities[{{ loop.index0 }}].details">{{ activity.details }}</span>.
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

</div>



<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div>
      <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="page-number">10/31/2022 9</div>
  </div>

  <p>“Ob ugroze utrazu russkim iazykom statusa mirovogo iazyka” (“On the Threat to Russian’s Status as a World Language”). Remarks delivered by video-recording to the International Internet Conference and Humanities Forum “The Russian Language Between Europe and Asia,” held at the Permskaya Yarmarka Exhibition Center, 65 Gagarin Boulevard, in Perm, Russia, 30 May–1 June 2013.</p>

  <p>Participant, ACTFL Oral Proficiency Interview Assessment Workshop, in Russian Group led by <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>, 19–22 July 2012.</p>

  <p>“In What Language Should a Contemporary Humanities Scholar Speak and Think?” Lecture presented to the XV Fulbright Summer School in the Humanities, “The Humanities as a Transnational Project,” Moscow State University, 26 June 2012. Discussant throughout the Summer School, 25–29 June 2012.</p>

  <p>Co-discussant, along with Martin Daughtry and Moni Yakim, for “Vladimir Vysotsky: The Voice of Russia in English Translation.” Russian Sundays Series. The 92d St. in New York City, 6 May 2012.</p>

  <p>Interview conducted 16 Feb. 2012 with journalist Vlad Morozov on Aleksandr Chudakov and my translation of his novel, aired on Radio Liberty’s Russian-language service, Radio Svoboda, 30 April 2012. <a href="{{ url }}">http://www.svoboda.ru/content/transcripts/24565569.html</a>.</p>

  <p>“Pasternak’s Shakespeare Under the Magnifying Glass” (Pasternak, Nikiforovskaya and Chukovskiy.” Revised version of my lecture to Columbia University of 1 October 2010. Delivered at Annual Meeting of AATSEEL, the American Association of Teachers of Slavic and East European Languages, Pasadena, CA, 7 Jan. 2011.</p>

  <p>“Pasternak’s Shakespeare Under the Magnifying Glass.” Lecture presented to the Columbia University Seminar on Slavic History and Culture, No. 497, 1 Oct. 2010.</p>

  <p>Fourth Annual LLC Research Conference. Panelist for Roundtable “Literature in as/on Exiles,” with visiting writer <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>, UAlbany, 16 April 2010.</p>

  <p>“New but Hardly Improved: Are Multiple Retranslations of Classics the Best Cultural Use to Make of Translation Talent?” 48th Annual Southern Conference on Slavic Studies, Gainesville, FL, 25 March 2010.</p>

  <p>“Pasternak and the ‘Museum Girls’: The Biographical Dimension of the Immortality Theme in <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>.” Paper delivered at the 41st National Convention of AAASS, the American Association for the Advancement of Slavic Studies, Boston, MA, 14 Nov. 2009.</p>

  <p>Chaired and assumed role of discussant for a panel, “Ethnonosticism: Connations Reflected in Semantics and Pragmatics of a Language,” at the 41st National Convention of AAASS, the American Association for the Advancement of Slavic Studies, Boston, MA, 14 Nov. 2009.</p>

  <p>“Aleksandr Blok iodno vybrannoe mesto iz perepiski Flobera.” (“Aleksandr Blok and a Selected Passage from the Correspondence of Flaubert.” Lecture delivered at the Graduate School Symposium of Middlebury College Russian School, VT, 25 July 2009.</p>

  <p>“Intertext as Translation: A Verse Reminiscence of Flaubert’s Correspondence in Aleksandr Blok’s Poem ‘Retribution.’” Presentation at “Texts on Texts,” Third Annual Research Conference, held at UAlbany, Department of Languages, Literatures and Cultures, 2 April 2009.</p>

  <p>“What’s Fowler to Us? Russian-English Translators and the Heritage of English Usage Dictionaries.” Paper delivered at the Annual Meeting of AATSEEL, the American</p>
</div>

